//- Formulario de inicio de sesión de usuario
doctype html
html(lang="es")
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
    title= titulo || 'Iniciar Sesión - SubastasPro'
    script(src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com")

  body(class="bg-slate-950 flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen font-sans antialiased")

    div(class="w-full max-w-md bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-8 backdrop-blur-xl")

      h1(class="text-3xl font-bold text-center text-white mb-2") Iniciar Sesión en SubastasPro
      p(class="text-center text-slate-400 mb-8") Ingresa tus datos para continuar.

      form(action="/api/autenticacion/login" method="POST" class="space-y-5")

        div
          label(class="block text-slate-300 mb-2 text-sm font-medium") Correo electrónico
          input(type="email" name="correo" placeholder="tu@correo.com" required class="w-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-white placeholder-slate-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500 transition-colors")

        div
          label(class="block text-slate-300 mb-2 text-sm font-medium") Contraseña
          input(type="password" name="clave" placeholder="********" required class="w-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-white placeholder-slate-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500 transition-colors")

        div(class="flex justify-between items-center text-sm")
          label(class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-400")
            input(type="checkbox" class="rounded border-slate-700 bg-slate-800 text-emerald-500")
            | Recordarme

          a(href="#" class="text-emerald-400 hover:underline") ¿Olvidaste tu contraseña?

        button(type="submit" class="w-full bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white font-semibold py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/20")
          | Iniciar Sesión

      p(class="text-center text-slate-400 text-sm mt-6")
        | ¿No tienes cuenta?
        a(href="/registro" class="text-emerald-400 ml-1 hover:underline font-medium") Regístrate aquí